"Now we have defined our profile we need to include it on our test class.\n"
"We do this by annotating the test class with "
"`@TestProfile(MockGreetingProfile.class)`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"All the test profile configuration is stored in a single class, which makes "
"it easy to tell if the previous test ran with the\n"
"same configuration."
