"As the injected instance is not available here we use `installMockForType`, "
"this mock is used for both test methods"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We use `installMockForInstance` to replace the injected bean, this takes "
"effect for the duration of the test method."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that there is no dependency on Mockito, you can use any mocking library "
"you like, or even manually override the\n"
"objects to provide the behaviour you require."
msgstr ""

msgid "Further simplification with <code>@InjectMock</code>"
